OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWednesday will start rather
OL,6,Fcloudy with some hill fog and patchy
OL,7,Fdrizzle. The cloud will lift and thin
OL,8,Fa little at times during the day,
OL,9,Fespecially in the south and east where
OL,10,Fbright intervals will develop. Feeling
OL,11,Fwarm and humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThere'll be some bright
OL,14,Fweather to end the day, but cloud will
OL,15,Fthicken from the northwest for a while
OL,16,Fovernight with showers breaking out.
OL,17,FClearer spells returning by the
OL,18,Fmorning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,165,160,301,260,100,100
PN,16402
