PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F164A1785300467
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FThursday will be a fresher
OL,6,Fday than recently. Patchy cloud at
OL,7,Ffirst will break up to give sunny
OL,8,Fspells during the day, although the
OL,9,Fodd light shower is also possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt looks
OL,12,Flargely dry on Friday and during the
OL,13,Fweekend. Though remaining a little
OL,14,Fcooler and fresher there will be some
OL,15,Fwarm spells of sunshine at times, with
OL,16,Fgentle winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
